      {"kind": "text", "rect": [228, 590, 60, 14], "text": "01", "style": "Step Number"},
      {"kind": "text", "slot": "feature1.title", "rect": [228, 606, 319, 28], "style": "Section Title", "sample": "The challenge"},
      {"kind": "text", "slot": "feature1.body", "rect": [228, 640, 319, 150], "style": "Body", "sample": [
        "Fernhill runs forty-two neighbourhood stores across the northern counties. Like most grocers, it ordered fresh produce from a mix of last year’s sales and each manager’s instinct, and like most grocers it threw a great deal of it away.",
        "Waste had crept up to nearly nine per cent of fresh sales. The team knew the cause was over-ordering on slow days, but every store was different, and no single rule fixed all of them."
      ]},
