      {"kind": "text", "slot": "feature2.title", "rect": [48, 94, 300, 28], "style": "Section Title", "sample": "The approach"},
      {"kind": "text", "slot": "feature2.body", "rect": [48, 128, 300, 180], "style": "Body", "sample": [
        "We spent the first two weeks on shop floors, not in spreadsheets, learning how managers actually placed orders. That shaped everything that followed.",
        "Together with Fernhill’s buyers we built a simple forecasting model that suggests an order for each product, each morning, and explains its reasoning in plain language. Managers can accept, adjust or ignore it. Six pilot stores tested it for a month before it went chain-wide."
      ]},
      {"kind": "image", "slot": "image1", "rect": [372, 82, 175, 226]},
